<title>USA: KCBT deliverable HRW wheat stocks.</title>
<headline>KCBT deliverable HRW wheat stocks.</headline>
<dateline>KANSAS CITY, MO 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Kansas City Board of Trade reported stocks of hard red winter wheat in deliverable position in exchange approved warehouses as of July 25, in 000 bushels. Note: Deliverable and non-deliverable grades exclude CCC stocks.</p>
<p>						July 25  WEEK    YEAR</p>
<p>							   AGO     AGO</p>
<p>						   KANSAS CITY AREA</p>
<p>Deliverable				  9,214  7,261   7,011</p>
<p>Non-deliverable				 24     28     106</p>
<p>CCC						827    827     949</p>
<p>TOTAL					 10,065  8,116   8,066</p>
<p>						    HUTCHINSON AREA</p>
<p>Deliverable				 22,485 20,622   4,415</p>
<p>Non-deliverable				204    203     206</p>
<p>CCC					    2,558  2,558   1,887</p>
<p>TOTAL					 25,247 23,383   6,508</p>
